      <description>&lt;p&gt;（日本語版：&lt;a href=&#34;../jp/&#34;&gt;2026 クラブカップ将棋対抗戦記&lt;/a&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I played in the Club Cup in Kobe for the first time in well over a decade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tournament-format&#34;&gt;Tournament Format&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3-player team competition&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After two preliminary games, teams are placed into one of four knockout brackets&lt;/p&gt;
